2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495649 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:77 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495652 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:78 *** Real frequency hopping requires:                                        ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495656 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:79 ***   - RF hardware with synchronized frequency synthesizer                 ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495659 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:80 ***   - TDMA frame-accurate hopping sequence generation                     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495663 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:81 ***   - Physical RF carrier switching at 217 hops/second                    ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495666 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:82 *** None of these are possible in the GSMTAP-based virtual environment.     ***
