2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495688 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:89 ***   - Spec comment line 42: 'The timeslots of Cells A and B are not      ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495693 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:90 ***     coincident at the antenna connector.'                               ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495697 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:91 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495700 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:92 *** Current infrastructure: single osmo-bts-virtual + single virtphy.       ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495703 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:93 *** No mechanism exists to instantiate or coordinate a second BTS cell.     ***
